    "COUP D'EAU - CYLINDRES FROIDS, OUVREZ LA VAPEUR DOUCEMENT - USURE {0}%{1}":"WATER HAMMER - COLD CYLINDERS, OPEN THE STEAM GENTLY - WEAR {0}%{1}",
