    "ROTARY RADIAL":"ROTARY RADIAL",
    "ROTORS ET APEX":"ROTORS AND APEX SEALS",
    "CULASSES":"CYLINDER HEADS",
    "L'huile choisie devient celle du carnet d'entretien : le menu HUILE jugera les vidanges d'apres elle.":"The chosen oil becomes the one in the service book: the OIL menu will judge oil changes against it.",
    "Les joints d'apex ferment les chambres a chaque sommet du rotor. Ils fixent le regime maxi et la tenue au cliquetis.":"The apex seals close the chambers at each tip of the rotor. They set the maximum revs and the knock resistance.",
    "L'arbre excentrique fait tourner les rotors. Il tient le couple et le regime.":"The eccentric shaft turns the rotors. It holds the torque and the revs.",
    "Les cylindres portent les lumieres. Plus solides, ils tiennent plus de pression : aucun cheval en plus.":"The cylinders carry the ports. Stronger ones hold more pressure: no extra horsepower.",
    "Le vilebrequin assemble porte la bielle. La course fait la cylindree ; ses roulements decident jusqu'ou il tourne.":"The built-up crankshaft carries the connecting rod. The stroke makes the displacement; its bearings decide how high it spins.",
    "Le pot de detente renvoie une onde qui bouche la lumiere au bon moment : il decide a quel regime le moteur se reveille.":"The expansion chamber sends back a wave that plugs the port at the right moment: it decides at which revs the engine wakes up.",
    "Un deux-temps graisse par son essence. Le graissage separe dose l'huile selon la charge ; l'huile competition tient les pleins gaz.":"A two-stroke is lubricated by its fuel. Separate lubrication doses the oil by load; racing oil withstands full throttle.",
    "Les lumieres du cylindre font la distribution : plus hautes, le moteur respire plus haut.":"The cylinder ports do the valve timing: higher ones make the engine breathe higher up.",
    "Le carter porte les rotors et tient le couple. Le nombre de rotors et leur chambre font la cylindree.":"The housing carries the rotors and holds the torque. The number of rotors and their chamber make the displacement.",
    "Les lumieres du carter font la distribution : plus grandes, le moteur respire plus haut et moins bien en bas.":"The housing ports do the timing: bigger ones make the engine breathe higher up and worse down low.",
    "Tout le moteur tourne autour du vilebrequin fixe. Le carter tournant tient la force centrifuge : il fixe le regime maxi.":"The whole engine spins around the fixed crankshaft. The rotating crankcase holds the centrifugal force: it sets the maximum revs.",
    "Le carter en etoile porte les cylindres autour du vilebrequin. Il tient le couple : aucun cheval en plus.":"The radial crankcase carries the cylinders around the crankshaft. It holds the torque: no extra horsepower.",
    "La bielle maitresse porte toutes les autres bielles. Elle fixe le regime maxi de l'etoile.":"The master rod carries all the other rods. It sets the maximum revs of the radial.",
    "POT DOUX":"MILD PIPE",
    "POT ROUTIER":"ROAD PIPE",
    "POT SPORT":"SPORT PIPE",
    "POT DE COURSE":"RACE PIPE",
    "POT DE COMPETITION":"COMPETITION PIPE",
