    "ACCORD A {0} TR":"TUNED AT {0} RPM",
    "Un deux temps essence ne se turbocompresse pas : la lumiere d'echappement s'ouvre avec le transfert, la pression partirait dans le pot.":"A petrol two-stroke is not turbocharged: the exhaust port opens with the transfer port, so the pressure would escape into the pipe.",
    "PRECONISEE {0}":"RECOMMENDED {0}",
