    "Developpe avec l'aide de Claude AI (Anthropic). Ce site n'est ni affilie a Anthropic, ni approuve par elle.":"Developed with the help of Claude AI (Anthropic). This site is neither affiliated with nor endorsed by Anthropic.",
    "ECHAPPEMENT":"EXHAUST",
