    "SEGMENTS ET LUMIERES":"RINGS AND PORTS",
    "Etancheite tenue plus haut en regime.":"Sealing holds higher up the rev range.",
    "Ouverture avancee : le rotatif respire mieux.":"Earlier opening: the rotary breathes better.",
