    "Plus aucune marge de securite.":"No safety margin left at all.",
    "RENFORCEMENT INTERNE":"INTERNAL STRENGTHENING",
    "Tient les regimes debloques par les lumieres.":"Handles the revs unlocked by the ports.",
    "Attelage sur pour un usage soutenu.":"Safe rotating assembly for sustained use.",
