    "Demande un attelage renforce.":"Requires a strengthened rotating assembly.",
    "Rien ne tient sans echangeur et sans attelage complet.":"Nothing holds without an intercooler and a fully built assembly.",
    "ECHANGEUR":"INTERCOOLER",
