    "Tient la pleine charge prolongee.":"Holds up to sustained full load.",
    "Le dernier degre a aller chercher.":"The last degree left to find.",
    "Encaisse un moteur prepare.":"Takes a tuned engine.",
    "Engagement plus sec, couple tenu.":"Sharper engagement, torque held.",
    "Tout ou rien. Inutilisable en ville.":"All or nothing. Unusable in town.",
    "D'origine sur la plupart des voitures.":"Standard on most cars.",
