    "Propulsion. Le transfert de masse travaille pour vous.":"Rear-wheel drive. Weight transfer works for you.",
    "Motricite maximale, un peu de poids en plus.":"Maximum traction, a little extra weight.",
    "Silencieux, durables, et vite depasses.":"Quiet, long-lasting, and quickly outclassed.",
    "Gomme tendre, usure rapide.":"Soft compound, quick wear.",
    "Presque lisses, homologues route.":"Almost slick, road legal.",
