    "AUTOMATIQUES":"AUTOMATIC",
    "Les pieces montees restent en place, mais elles ne seront plus modifiables palier par palier : la Conception regle des valeurs, pas des pieces. Il n'y a pas de retour.":"The fitted parts stay in place, but they can no longer be changed stage by stage: Design sets values, not parts. There is no going back.",
    "Un moteur electrique n'a ni admission, ni echappement, ni cames, ni suralimentation. Il n'y a rien a preparer ici : sa puissance se regle directement en CONCEPTION.":"An electric motor has no intake, no exhaust, no cams and no forced induction. There is nothing to tune here: its power is set directly in DESIGN.",
    "Un rapport de plus, echelle resserree, passages sans synchro.":"One more gear, closer ratios, shifts without synchro.",
