    "Reprend mieux partout, plafonne plus tot.":"Pulls better everywhere, tops out sooner.",
    "TRES COURTS":"VERY SHORT",
    "Etagement circuit. La pointe n'est plus l'objectif.":"Track gearing. Top speed is no longer the goal.",
    "LONGS":"LONG",
    "Pour la vitesse pure. Molasse a la reprise.":"For pure speed. Sluggish when accelerating.",
