    "Amortisseurs reglables, caisse mieux tenue.":"Adjustable dampers, better body control.",
    "Tres raide, tres bas. Inconduisible sur route degradee.":"Very stiff, very low. Undrivable on a poor road.",
    "Meme diametre, mordant et tenue en hausse.":"Same diameter, more bite and fade resistance.",
    "Plus de bras de levier et plus de surface.":"More leverage and more surface.",
    "Ne cuit plus. Mord mal a froid : le premier freinage est long.":"No more fade. Bites poorly when cold: the first stop is long.",
