    "- MOTEUR TRANSPOSE : {0} -> {1} TR, COUPLE {2}":"- ENGINE ADAPTED: {0} -> {1} RPM, TORQUE {2}",
    "Masse en mouvement : {0} + {1} = {2} kg. Centre de gravite a {3} cm (il suit la GARDE AU SOL du menu SUSPENSION), soit {4} de transfert de masse par g - une berline est a 0.18. La roue avant se leve a {5} g, la roue arriere a {6} g au freinage. Rallonger l'empattement ou baisser la garde au sol recule les deux, exactement comme sur une moto de drag.":"Mass in motion: {0} + {1} = {2} kg. Centre of gravity at {3} cm (it follows the GROUND CLEARANCE in the SUSPENSION menu), i.e. {4} of load transfer per g - a saloon is at 0.18. The front wheel lifts at {5} g, the rear wheel at {6} g under braking. Lengthening the wheelbase or lowering the ground clearance pushes both back, exactly as on a drag bike.",
    "un scooter ou un cyclomoteur":"a scooter or a moped",
    "une 125 ou un roadster compact":"a 125 or a compact roadster",
