    "{0} Hz, fermete {1}, course {2} mm, garde {3} mm.":"{0} Hz, firmness {1}, travel {2} mm, clearance {3} mm.",
    "AVANT+ARRIERE":"FRONT+REAR",
    "avant plus raide que l'arriere : montage de monoplace a appui, la caisse tangue longtemps sur route":"front stiffer than rear: a downforce single-seater setup, the body pitches for a long time on the road",
    "les deux essieux repondent ensemble : neutre, mais sans le confort du flat ride":"both axles respond together: neutral, but without the comfort of flat ride",
    "arriere plus raide dans le bon rapport : la caisse cesse de tanguer d'elle-meme apres une bosse, c'est le flat ride des berlines":"rear stiffer in the right ratio: the body stops pitching by itself after a bump, it is the flat ride of saloons",
    "arriere beaucoup trop raide : la voiture martele et l'arriere sautille":"rear far too stiff: the car hammers and the rear hops",
    "Rapport arriere/avant : {0} - {1}.":"Rear/front ratio: {0} - {1}.",
    "Assiette a plat.":"Level stance.",
    "Assiette {0} mm : {1}":"Stance {0} mm: {1}",
    "arriere releve. Cela remonte le centre de gravite cote arriere et AUGMENTE le transfert de masse au depart - la raison d'etre du cul releve des dragsters.":"rear raised. This raises the centre of gravity at the rear and INCREASES load transfer at launch - the reason dragsters have their tail up.",
    "nez en l'air. On perd du transfert au depart, on en gagne au freinage.":"nose up. You lose transfer at launch and gain it under braking.",
    "{0} Fermete de {1} a {2}. Perte a chaud : {3} %.{4}":"{0} Firmness from {1} to {2}. Loss when hot: {3} %.{4}",
    "Non reglable.":"Not adjustable.",
    "Pilote en continu.":"Continuously controlled.",
    "{0} voie(s) de reglage.":"{0}-way adjustable.",
    "berline confort (0.9 a 1.2 Hz)":"comfort saloon (0.9 to 1.2 Hz)",
    "GT ou berline sport (1.4 a 1.8 Hz)":"GT or sport saloon (1.4 to 1.8 Hz)",
    "sportive ferme de route (1.9 a 2.3 Hz)":"firm road sports car (1.9 to 2.3 Hz)",
    "circuit ou silhouette (2.5 a 3.5 Hz)":"track or silhouette racer (2.5 to 3.5 Hz)",
    "monoplace a appui aerodynamique (4 Hz et plus)":"downforce single-seater (4 Hz and above)",
    "Vous etes dans le domaine {0}. La frequence propre est la facon dont les ingenieurs comparent des raideurs : une meme raideur en N/mm ne veut rien dire sans la masse qui pese dessus.":"You are in the {0} range. Natural frequency is how engineers compare stiffnesses: the same stiffness in N/mm means nothing without the mass bearing on it.",
    "confort d'origine":"stock comfort",
    "route sportive":"sporty road",
    "route tres ferme":"very firm road",
    "Taux d'amortissement reduit en basse vitesse de piston (moins de 50 mm/s) : c'est lui qui commande la plongee et le cabrage. Vous etes en reglage {0}. En vrai, la detente est toujours reglee deux a trois fois plus ferme que la compression : la caisse s'ecrase vite et se releve lentement.{1}":"Damping ratio at low piston speed (under 50 mm/s): it controls dive and squat. You are on the {0} setting. In reality, rebound is always set two to three times firmer than compression: the body compresses quickly and rises slowly.{1}",
    "Vous etes au maximum de ce type d'amortisseur.":"You are at the limit of this type of damper.",
    "circuit ou silhouette (50 a 80 mm)":"track or silhouette racer (50 to 80 mm)",
    "sportive de route (100 a 130 mm)":"road sports car (100 to 130 mm)",
    "berline (160 a 200 mm)":"saloon (160 to 200 mm)",
    "rallye (150 a 300 mm)":"rally (150 to 300 mm)",
    "rallye-raid ou trophy truck (400 a 600 mm)":"rally raid or trophy truck (400 to 600 mm)",
    "Course totale de roue, detente plus compression. Domaine {0}. Elle ne sert que sur sol irregulier : sur un billard, il n'y a rien a absorber.":"Total wheel travel, rebound plus compression. {0} range. It only matters on uneven ground: on a billiard table, there is nothing to absorb.",
    "quasi nul":"almost zero",
    "valeur de serie (10 a 30 %)":"production value (10 to 30 %)",
    "pont rigide a lames (60 a 100 %)":"leaf-sprung live axle (60 to 100 %)",
    "montage 4-link de dragster (100 a 130 %)":"dragster 4-link setup (100 to 130 %)",
    "Part du transfert de masse qui passe par la GEOMETRIE DES BRAS au lieu des ressorts - donc qui arrive sans aucun delai. Reglage {0}. Au-dela de 100 %, la caisse ne s'assied plus du tout : elle se souleve et plaque l'essieu. C'est une grandeur d'essieu ARRIERE : c'est l'arriere qui s'assied a l'acceleration, et c'est ce chiffre-la qui entre dans le transfert de masse.":"Share of load transfer that goes through the ARM GEOMETRY instead of the springs - so it arrives with no delay. Setting {0}. Beyond 100 %, the body no longer squats at all: it lifts and plants the axle. It is a REAR axle quantity: it is the rear that squats under acceleration, and it is this figure that enters the load transfer.",
    "quasi nul : la caisse plonge librement au freinage":"almost zero: the body dives freely under braking",
    "valeur de serie (30 a 50 %)":"production value (30 to 50 %)",
    "eleve, plutot sportif":"high, rather sporty",
    "tres eleve : la caisse ne plonge plus mais encaisse tout dans les bras":"very high: the body no longer dives but takes everything through the arms",
    "ANTI-PLONGEE : part du transfert de masse qui passe par la GEOMETRIE DES BRAS AVANT au freinage, donc sans delai. Reglage {0}. C'est le pendant exact de l'anti-squat arriere, mais il agit pied leve et non a l'acceleration.":"ANTI-DIVE: share of load transfer that goes through the FRONT ARM GEOMETRY under braking, so with no delay. Setting {0}. It is the exact counterpart of rear anti-squat, but it acts off throttle rather than under acceleration.",
    "circuit (50 a 70 mm)":"track (50 to 70 mm)",
    "sportive (80 a 110 mm)":"sports car (80 to 110 mm)",
    "serie (130 a 160 mm)":"production (130 to 160 mm)",
    "rallye terre (250 a 300 mm)":"gravel rally (250 to 300 mm)",
    "raid (350 mm et plus)":"raid (350 mm and above)",
    "Domaine {0}. Elle commande la hauteur du centre de gravite, donc l'AMPLITUDE du transfert de masse - la ou la fermete n'en commande que la vitesse. Rabaisser une propulsion lui fait perdre de la motricite au depart arrete : c'est pour cette raison exacte que les dragsters relevent l'arriere.":"{0} range. It controls the height of the centre of gravity, hence the AMOUNT of load transfer - whereas firmness only controls its speed. Lowering a rear-wheel drive costs traction from a standing start: that is exactly why dragsters raise the rear.",
